# Code owners for QA Brain (chinmaydhokey/MCP_server).
# GitHub requests a review from the owners of every path a pull request touches.
# The last matching pattern wins. Per-workstream owners (A gateway/transports,
# B store/healing/TIA, C mobile/parity, D runner/GitHub/dashboard/research) are
# filled in at M1 when the team is assigned; until then both maintainers own
# every path. See docs/roadmap.md for the workstream definitions.

